  "prefLabel": "Puc 201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 201.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this chapter is to ensure the lawful and efficient processing of all filings submitted to the commission and the just and timely disposition of all matters before the commission.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
